# Storage, Cache, Offline

## Storage choices
- ✅ Shared prefs: small non-sensitive flags/settings
- ✅ Secure storage: tokens/credentials
- ✅ DB (Hive/Isar/SQLite): structured offline data (pick one and standardize)

## Offline strategy
- ✅ Define per feature:
  - cache keying
  - sync strategy
  - conflict handling
  - error states when offline

## Data lifecycle
- ✅ Clear sensitive data on logout
- ✅ Provide migrations strategy for DB schema changes

## NEVER
- ❌ Store secrets in shared prefs
- ❌ Scatter storage calls in widgets
